  "body": "Thank you so much for using Orca and for your continued support! ❤️\n\nThis is a patch on top of v1.4.206.\n\n## The short version\n\n**File search:** Quick Open and the file explorer no longer flash the previous results while a new search is loading.\n\n---\n\n## Product experience\n\n### File search\n\n*A new query shows nothing from the last one until its own results arrive.*\n\n* Fix stale listings when search query changes by @AmethystLiang in https://github.com/stablyai/orca/pull/22173\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/stablyai/orca/compare/v1.4.206...v1.4.207\n",
